#doc (Manual) "Weil–Petersson volumes: v3 mathematical blueprint" =>

This document preserves the paper statements and proof exposition, with separate mathematical
dependency edges and external inputs. As of the R35 audit, stage one is complete as a conditional
formalization: all 57 numbered results and all 92 registered paper contributions are covered,
with 7 VERIFIED and 85 CONDITIONAL paper contributions.
No registered paper contribution remains open.

Stage two remains unfinished. The project retains 77 groups of classical inputs (50 explicit
interfaces and 27 external-sorry groups), with 38 external sorry roots. Concrete DM/WP and other
classical instances, and a machine proof that all interfaces can be satisfied together, remain
unconstructed. The paper has therefore not yet received an unconditional formal verification.

Informal proofs are not checked Lean proofs. Original paper numbering appears in the source chips;
Verso numbering is independent.

